openmixer-release (1-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The package of 1-7, released: the 1-7 run was refused by the installability
    gate, which read the FreeREAC channel without its noarch tree, where
    freereac-release lives. Depends on freereac-release (>= 1-2): the floor
    the gate asks of every dependency between our own packages, now that this
    channel serves freereac-release (the mirror).

